# Kestrel default system Flatpaks — installed automatically ~30s after first boot
# (and re-checked every boot). One Flatpak app ID per line.
# Only the essentials: the base image's Firefox and KDE Discover are removed, so these
# replace them. Install everything else (Steam, Heroic, Lutris, VLC…) yourself from Bazaar.
# If you install Steam, kestrel-flatpak-extras adds the matching MangoHud/gamescope layers.

